From 86b4181b825ad4e389ca47bd8c594f92f18fbbb2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ReArc Overlay <overlay@rearc.invalid>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 18:29:21 +0400
Subject: [PATCH] P-TAB-001 wave 14: expose Chromium page zoom and change
 events

Use the upstream ZoomController in default HostZoomMap mode, suppress the Chrome bubble, and add factor get/set plus typed zoom callbacks. Preserve per-host sharing, profile isolation and ZoomLevelPrefs persistence. Add page_zoom in ABI 1.8 without changing old callback layouts.

Last rebased: 2026-11-02 onto Chromium 156.0.8078.74 (d331de35ca).

Co-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>
---
